# NET-2 pass 1: replication core - stable objects (cooked records, NetId = record id) replicate as STATE, never as
# spawns: PROPERTY(Replicated) in reflection (PropertyMetadata::Replicated, DesertHeaderTool), the store's per-field
# change versions (push: a write bumps the version), per-connection acked baselines in the Gateway (ObjectState on the
# State lane, StateAck window of 32, a lost packet re-sends only its fields), quantized transform fragment (1 mm,
# smallest-three 3x10 bits). Server console on stdin: set <id> <Component>.<Field> <v> | transform <id> x y z [rx ry rz] | stat.
# Runner: <scratch>/NET-2/run_net2.sh (base run_net1e.sh, camera --camera 0,400,1400), clients A, B, then C 30 s later.
# Pass 2: the server refuses a console `set` on a field that is not Replicated, by name (UE replicates only
# UPROPERTY(Replicated)); the layout it checks is Engine/Generated/ReplicatedFields.gen.cpp (DesertHeaderTool, CoreReflection).
# Runner: <scratch>/NET-2/run_all.sh = run_net2.sh {A,B} before, {A,B,C} after; one camera --camera 0,400,1400 at 200977
# (cell record at (1250,-404,-1250)); the console lifts it 300 cm: transform 200977 1250 -104 -1250.
# Дано: DesertServer on WP_Protocol, clients A and B joined.
# Тогда [clientB_before] net2-B-before/clientB_before.png: the cube stands on the ground.
# Когда: the server console lifts entity 200977 by 300 cm.
# Тогда [clientA_after] net2-A-after/clientA_after.png: the cube lifted, its shadow apart from it.
# Тогда [clientB_after] net2-B-after/clientB_after.png: the same.
# Когда: client C joins 30 s later.
# Тогда [clientC_first] net2-C-after/clientC_after.png: C's first frame shows the cube lifted; server.log net stat
#   "1 stable object(s) replicated as state, 0 as spawns".
# Когда: the server console sets DirectionLight.Color (not Replicated).
# Тогда [server_refusal] server.log "refused - DirectionLight.Color is not a Replicated field"; no client log names Color.
